<title>USA: Grant Geophysical president/CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Grant Geophysical president/CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grant Geophysical Inc said on Wednesday that George Tilley, its president, chief executive officer and interim chairman of the board, resigned effective November 4.</p>
<p>Harvey Attra, a director of the international geophysical services company, was named acting board chairman and Thomas Portwood Jr. was named president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Portwood was previously a consultant in the international seismic industry. He has been chief executive officer of United Geophysical and chief operating officer of Seiscom Delta United, Grant said.</p>
